Now I've been playing The Game for about 3 weeks, and I'm ready to
give some trivial advice to other novices. These advices are written
in no particular order.

Don't put a wand of cancellation or a bag of tricks into a bag of
holding. It will explode.

Don't keep your luckstone in a bag, it won't work.

Collect all lizard corpses, they are good against petrifying.

Tin giant mummy meat and eat it. It's good for you. (Actually tinning
makes all mummy meat edible)

If you get a magic lamp, be sure it is blessed before you rub it.

Offering unicorns to god is very profitable.

If you get into a money chamber and a guard shows up asking your name,
answer "Kroisos", but be sure to have some means to get outta there.
(pick axe, wand of digging, teleport scroll or wand)

Pets dont step on cursed items.

Pets can steal some useful items from shops. (Once I got Gauntlets of
Power and Fire Brand -sword from levels 2 and 3)

Giving 400 X your experience level to a priest lowers your armor class
by 3 all subsequent donations (400 X exp.l) lower armor class by 1.

